Third-party software
--------------------

Bookcomet depends on open-source Python and npm packages declared in
`backend/requirements.txt` and `frontend/package-lock.json`. Those
packages retain their own copyright and license terms. Review lockfiles
and each package’s license before redistribution.

Optional / not redistributed in this repository
-----------------------------------------------

- Poppler (GPL) may be downloaded locally for PDF rasterization. The
  `bin/poppler/` tree is gitignored and is not part of the Bookcomet-a
  source release. See `bin/README.md`.
- OCR, VLM, and LLM providers (for example DeepSeek-compatible or
  OpenAI-compatible gateways) are configured by the operator. Bookcomet
  does not bundle those models or their weights.
- No Stripe CLI binary or other unexplained vendor executable is
  included in this repository.

Trademarks
----------

